sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(Notebook / Service)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS_Py as Feature Server (Python)<br/>6566/TCP HTTP/gRPC
    participant FS_Go as Feature Server (Go)<br/>6566/TCP HTTP/gRPC
    participant Redis as Online Store<br/>(Redis/PostgreSQL)<br/>TCP Configurable TLS
    participant Offline as Offline Store<br/>(BigQuery/Snowflake)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Registry as Registry Backend<br/>(S3/GCS/SQL)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as Feast Operator<br/>Go

    Note over Client,Redis: Flow 1: Online Feature Retrieval
    Client->>Route: POST /get-online-features<br/>Auth: K8s RBAC / OIDC / None
    Route->>FS_Py: Forward request<br/>Configurable TLS
    FS_Py->>Redis: Query features<br/>Backend credentials
    Redis-->>FS_Py: Feature values
    FS_Py-->>Route: JSON/Protobuf response
    Route-->>Client: Feature response

    Note over Client,Redis: Flow 1b: High-Performance Online Retrieval (Go)
    Client->>FS_Go: POST /get-online-features<br/>HTTP
    FS_Go->>Redis: Query features<br/>Backend credentials
    Redis-->>FS_Go: Feature values
    FS_Go-->>Client: Feature response

    Note over Client,Offline: Flow 2: Feature Materialization
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create CronJob<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Note right of K8sAPI: CronJob triggers on schedule
    K8sAPI->>FS_Py: POST /materialize<br/>ServiceAccount
    FS_Py->>Offline: Query historical features<br/>Cloud credentials (TLS 1.2+)
    Offline-->>FS_Py: Historical data
    FS_Py->>Redis: Write materialized features<br/>Backend credentials
    Redis-->>FS_Py: Ack

    Note over Operator,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Operator Reconciliation
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: FeatureStore CR watch event
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Get/Create/Update resources<br/>ServiceAccount token (TLS 1.2+)
    Note right of Operator: Creates: Deployments, Services,<br/>ConfigMaps, PVCs, HPAs, PDBs,<br/>CronJobs, Roles, RoleBindings, Routes

    Note over Operator,K8sAPI: Flow 4: Notebook Config Injection
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Notebook CR watch event
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMap<br/>with feast client config
